  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Matchmaking port development Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to support the Port development trade mission 18-22 September 2023 to Kenya with matchmaking. Dutch companies participating in the trade will be introduced to selected Kenyan companies for investigating further cooperation. Focus is on Nairobi and Mombasa.Port development has a broad approach here, the mission is open to parties active in port development or the maritime sector; supply hardware and (digital) technology, such as customs and/or tracking systems; work in the field of knowledge and innovation; contribute to port development with sustainable solutions, such as solar solutions and smart cooling systems.</narrative>
  </description>
